    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Kingdom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Keep is a minimalist strategy game with hack and slash, inspired by Thronefall. By day you build your kingdom; when the night starts you defend it with towers, troops, and your hero\u2019s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/80533ca725e4655a0fc8d58b7f4166f2.poster.avif?t=1751402759\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/80533ca725e4655a0fc8d58b7f4166f2.webm?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/80533ca725e4655a0fc8d58b7f4166f2.mp4?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance Economy and Defense</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, Night Keep strips away unnecessary complexity while staying challenging, inviting players to devise their own strategies. Choose from a range of buildings, each with unique abilities and upgrade paths, and find the right balance between economy and defense for every level. Build houses, windmills, and fields that generate gold if they survive the night, but don\u2019t get too greedy. Invest in towers with three distinct upgrade routes, or in barracks to raise an army of active ragdolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/79e34b4bf01cef91f0180b64d387c6e5.poster.avif?t=1751402759\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/79e34b4bf01cef91f0180b64d387c6e5.webm?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/79e34b4bf01cef91f0180b64d387c6e5.mp4?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select Class &amp; Fight Ragdolls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Keep offers three classes, each with two unique abilities. You can play all three classes at once and switch seamlessly during battle. Hack and slash through waves of twenty different ragdolls. Customize your playstyle by selecting perks and challenges before each level. Night Keep has seven levels that deliver around five to eight hours of playtime, plus higher difficulties and an endless mode for those chasing a new high score.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/0230e76f6d3c3198ddeac2d49571e8d6.poster.avif?t=1751402759\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/0230e76f6d3c3198ddeac2d49571e8d6.webm?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/0230e76f6d3c3198ddeac2d49571e8d6.mp4?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three playable classes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seven levels  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 13 buildings  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 unique enemies  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Normal, difficult, endless mode  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two Quests per level </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High score system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 15 perks and 10 challenges </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play in 3rd person or fixed birds-eye perspective</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Kingdom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Keep is a minimalist strategy game with hack and slash, inspired by Thronefall. By day you build your kingdom; when the night starts you defend it with towers, troops, and your hero\u2019s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/80533ca725e4655a0fc8d58b7f4166f2.poster.avif?t=1751402759\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/80533ca725e4655a0fc8d58b7f4166f2.webm?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/80533ca725e4655a0fc8d58b7f4166f2.mp4?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance Economy and Defense</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, Night Keep strips away unnecessary complexity while staying challenging, inviting players to devise their own strategies. Choose from a range of buildings, each with unique abilities and upgrade paths, and find the right balance between economy and defense for every level. Build houses, windmills, and fields that generate gold if they survive the night, but don\u2019t get too greedy. Invest in towers with three distinct upgrade routes, or in barracks to raise an army of active ragdolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/79e34b4bf01cef91f0180b64d387c6e5.poster.avif?t=1751402759\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/79e34b4bf01cef91f0180b64d387c6e5.webm?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/79e34b4bf01cef91f0180b64d387c6e5.mp4?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select Class &amp; Fight Ragdolls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Keep offers three classes, each with two unique abilities. You can play all three classes at once and switch seamlessly during battle. Hack and slash through waves of twenty different ragdolls. Customize your playstyle by selecting perks and challenges before each level. Night Keep has seven levels that deliver around five to eight hours of playtime, plus higher difficulties and an endless mode for those chasing a new high score.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/0230e76f6d3c3198ddeac2d49571e8d6.poster.avif?t=1751402759\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/0230e76f6d3c3198ddeac2d49571e8d6.webm?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089580/extras/0230e76f6d3c3198ddeac2d49571e8d6.mp4?t=1751402759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three playable classes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seven levels  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 13 buildings  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 unique enemies  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Normal, difficult, endless mode  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two Quests per level </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High score system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 15 perks and 10 challenges </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play in 3rd person or fixed birds-eye perspective</p>",
